Vela name and marks
===================

The Vela name, sail, wordmark, and lockups are trademark rights reserved. They
are not licensed under the repository's Apache-2.0 OR MIT code license.

`vela-readme-hero.jpg` presents the Vela sail and wordmark over an editorial,
non-authoritative cartography backdrop. It contains no Repository data,
scientific record, or protocol diagram. The Vela identity in the foreground is
a trademark asset; the generated background plate serves this README
presentation only.

Do not redesign, extract, or reinterpret the sail or wordmark from this image.
The repository publishes no canonical vector brand source. Brand changes belong
in the governed brand package in `vela-science/vela-web`; an exported copy
returns here only when a tracked Vela surface consumes it.
